{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017113619778-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017122426\"/><p>蘋果旗艦摺疊機iPhone Duo於本周五（16日）晚上8時開放預購，引發搶購熱潮。據悉，執法人員接獲逾百名市民報案，指信用卡懷疑被盜用購買蘋果手機，涉款達數百萬港元。</p><p>有網民在社交平台反映，收到滙豐銀行發出兩次的信用卡扣款短訊34,998港元，懷疑信用卡被盜用，遂致電客服，惟未有人接聽；亦有兩名網民表示訂購1部機收到4次及5次扣款短訊。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:21.789570+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:36:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:18:03.796799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:38.465779+00:00","content_hash":"f57e986555fa1cba85aed457c0c43b4d01c15f0c3f654948888887f287ae0a99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}